    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="FR-04">Scope: compute an email-specific RI-confidence from triage urgency × deterministic-rung agreement and pass it into `CommunicationAssessedSignal`, replacing the hardcoded 0. A high-urgency well-associated email scores ≥ the rule-gate threshold and fires `CommunicationRiActionService`; noise does not.</constraint>
    <constraint source="D-08">Scope: the scorer is EMAIL-SPECIFIC; MUST NOT reuse the Workspace/Portfolio priority scoring. Compute from triage urgency + deterministic-rung agreement only.</constraint>
    <constraint source="C-5">Scope: exact weights + threshold are tuned during implementation against an eval set; record the chosen values + rationale in the task note. Start from the urgency × rung-agreement blend.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project (feed, don't fork)">Scope: do NOT modify the shipped `CommunicationRuleGate` / `CommunicationRiActionService` behavior beyond feeding the real confidence; the notification path already exists.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-04">Scope: the scorer MUST be best-effort — a failure degrades to a safe low/neutral confidence + log, never throws into the capture/enrichment path.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-013 / NFR-03">Scope: if urgency comes from an AI signal, read it via `Services/Ai/PublicContracts/`; MUST NOT inject `IOpenAiClient`/`IPlaybookService` into the scorer/Communication code.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project §10">Scope: BFF Hygiene — load `.claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md`; state the Placement Justification in the PR (scorer helper on the enrichment path; feeds the shipped signal); report publish-size delta vs ~49.63 MB baseline (expected ≈0); no new HIGH CVE; update tests in `tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/`; `/conflict-check` before the PR (shared `Services/Communication/`).</constraint>
  </constraints>

